<title>USA: Charter One Financial sets quarterly div.</title>
<headline>Charter One Financial sets quarterly div.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter One Financial Inc said Wednesday it has set a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.23 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend represents a 5 percent increase over the previous quarter's $0.219 cash dividend, adjusting for the 5 percent stock dividend distributed on September 30, it said.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable November 18 to shareholders of record as of November 1.</p>
</text>
